# .linkcheckignore
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with `#` are comments.
# Patterns match INTERNAL link paths (e.g. `/foo/bar`).
# Glob syntax:  *  matches within a segment,  **  matches across segments.
#
# Examples (uncomment to use):
# /preview/*           # any single-segment preview URL
# /blog/**             # entire blog subtree (e.g. drafts not yet built)
# /docs/coming-soon
#
# For advanced options (ignore by source file, sitemap-only ignores,
# custom redirects), use link-check.config.json instead.
